# R7 contract examples — documentation only; not executed in Phase 7.
# Execution belongs to Phase 8 in an isolated local environment. Replace placeholders deliberately.
# Never store production tokens or secrets here.
@baseUrl = https://localhost:REPLACE_WITH_CONFIGURED_HTTPS_PORT
@token = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_TOKEN
@userWordId = REPLACE_WITH_OWNED_USER_WORD_ID
@preferredDefinitionId = REPLACE_WITH_CANONICAL_DEFINITION_ID
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID_FROM_START
@questionId = REPLACE_WITH_QUESTION_ID_FROM_START

### E01 Register — anonymous; 200 nested ApiResult<AuthResponse>; VE/duplicate AE 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"REPLACE_WITH_UNIQUE_LOCAL_USERNAME","email":"local-test@example.invalid","password":"REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_PASSWORD"}

### E02 Login — anonymous; 200 nested auth; VE 400, AE 401/409/500
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"REPLACE_WITH_UNIQUE_LOCAL_USERNAME","password":"REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_PASSWORD"}

### E03 Profile — 200 ApiResult<UserDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### E04 Change password — 200 non-generic ApiResult with null data/error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_TEST_PASSWORD","newPassword":"REPLACE_WITH_NEW_LOCAL_TEST_PASSWORD"}

### E05 Validate token — returns UserDto without issuing another token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/validate-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### E06 Lookup — Bearer required by fallback; 404 miss / 503 provider unavailable
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/words/lookup/hello
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### E07 Add canonical word after lookup — duplicate remains 200
# Optional preferredWordDefinitionId must belong to canonical word on a new add.
# Legacy definition/example/pronunciation remain accepted but ignored; POS is a selection fallback.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/words/vocabulary/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"word":"hello"}

### E08 Vocabulary — complete paginated typed response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/words/vocabulary?page=1&pageSize=20&term=hello&startsWithLetter=h
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### E09 Search — absent/blank term gives full empty response; at most 5 items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/words/vocabulary/search?term=hello
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### E10 Favorite — explicit false valid; omitted isFavorite gives validation_failed 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/words/vocabulary/{{userWordId}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"isFavorite":false}

### E11 Preferred definition — same row; missing/nonowned concealed as 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/words/vocabulary/{{userWordId}}/preferred-definition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"preferredWordDefinitionId":{{preferredDefinitionId}}}

### E12 Start quiz — process-local 30-minute session; no answer key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quiz/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"questionCount":10,"mode":"mixed"}

### E13 Submit — selectedOptionId explicitly present; 0 valid; no automatic retry
# Omitted answers/[] is valid and scores all questions unanswered.
# Unknown/nonowned/expired/removed: 404; concurrency/recognized persisted duplicate: 409.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quiz/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionId":"{{sessionId}}","answers":[{"questionId":"{{questionId}}","selectedOptionId":0}]}

### E14 History — no sessionId on items; take capped at 20
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/quiz/history?take=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Contracts: ../Docs/Updates/R7-api-contract-reference.md.
# AE = six-field application/json. VE = extended application/problem+json.
# Framework Bearer 401 may have an empty body.